            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Death Burst"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(aura, necromancy, occult)\n\nWhen the bloodsiphon dies, its body explodes in a cloudy red burst of necrotic dried blood in a 20-foot area. Creatures in range must attempt a 21 Reflex save.\n\n- **Critical Success:** The creature is unaffected.\n- **Success:** The creature takes 2d6 negative damage.\n- **Failure:** The creature takes 4d6 negative damage.\n- **Critical Failure:** The creature takes 6d6 negative damage and is enfeebled 2 for 1 hour."
